{"id":"12A","title":"Chastity and Virtue","part":{"n":12,"title":"Etiquette and moral issues"},"url":"/law/12-etiquette-and-moral-issues/12a","entries":[{"id":"12A.1","text":"Chastity commanded; and that you not to be fornicators.","refs":[{"book":"Acts","chapter":15,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"5"},{"book":"1 Thessalonians","chapter":4,"verses":"3"},{"book":"Titus","chapter":2,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"Acts 15:20 Col. 3:5; 1 Thes. 4:3; Titus 2:5."},{"id":"12A.2","text":"We should be chaste in the heart.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":6,"verses":"25"}],"citation":"Prov. 6:25."},{"id":"12A.3","text":"We are to keep the body in chastity.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":6,"verses":"13,15-19"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 6:13, 15-19."},{"id":"12A.4","text":"Chastity is preserved by wisdom and discretion.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":2,"verses":"10-11"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":7,"verses":"1-5"}],"citation":"Prov. 2:10-11; Prov. 7:1-5."},{"id":"12A.5","text":"We should not keep company with those devoid of chastity.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":5,"verses":"11"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":4,"verses":"3"}],"citation":"1 Cor 5:11; 1 Pet 4:3."},{"id":"12A.6","text":"Keep yourself pure in mind and heart.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":73,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":22,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":5,"verses":"8"},{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":5,"verses":"22"},{"book":"James","chapter":4,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Psa. 73:1; Prov. 22:11; Matt. 5:8; 1 Tim. 5:22; James 4:8."},{"id":"12A.7","text":"Immoral and unchaste conduct (works of the flesh) excludes entry into the Kingdom of God.","refs":[{"book":"Galatians","chapter":5,"verses":"19-21"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":5,"verses":"5"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":13,"verses":"4"}],"citation":"Gal. 5:19-21; Eph. 5:5; Heb. 13:4."},{"id":"12A.8","text":"Abstain and turn away from every form of evil.","refs":[{"book":"Job","chapter":1,"verses":"1"},{"book":"1 Thessalonians","chapter":5,"verses":"22"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":3,"verses":"10-11"}],"citation":"Job 1:1 18; 1 Thes. 5:22; 1 Pet 3:10-11."},{"id":"12A.9","text":"A virtuous person should let their mind dwell on those things which are true, honorable, just, pure, lovely, and of good report.","refs":[{"book":"Philippians","chapter":4,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Phil. 4:8."},{"id":"12A.10","text":"It is chaste to add virtue in your faith and knowledge to virtue.","refs":[{"book":"2 Peter","chapter":1,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"2 Pet. 1:5."},{"id":"12A.11","text":"Virtue in women is a highly desired attribute.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":30,"verses":"10-31"}],"citation":"Prov. 30:10-31."},{"id":"12A.12","text":"A gracious woman retains honor.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":11,"verses":"16"}],"citation":"Prov. 11:16."},{"id":"12A.13","text":"You shall do what is right and good in the sight of the LORD, that it may be well with you.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":6,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"Deut. 6:18."},{"id":"12A.14","text":"As a ring of gold in a swine's snout, so is a beautiful woman who lacks discretion.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":11,"verses":"22"}],"citation":"Prov. 11:22."},{"id":"12A.15","text":"Whoredom and prostitution is forbidden.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"29"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":22,"verses":"21"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":23,"verses":"17"}],"citation":"Lev. 19:29; Deut. 22:21; Deut. 23:17."},{"id":"12A.16","text":"Whoremongers condemned.","refs":[{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":5,"verses":"5"},{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":1,"verses":"10"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":13,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":21,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":22,"verses":"15"}],"citation":"Eph. 5:5; 1 Tim. 1:10; Heb. 13:4; Rev. 21:8; Rev. 22:15."},{"id":"12A.17","text":"To the pure all things are pure, but to those who are defiled and unbelieving nothing is pure.","refs":[{"book":"Titus","chapter":1,"verses":"15"}],"citation":"Titus 1:15."},{"id":"12A.18","text":"Punishment and consequences for breach of chaste conduct.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":5,"verses":"3-11"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":7,"verses":"25-27"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":3,"verses":"16-17"}],"citation":"Prov. 5:3-11; Prov. 7:25-27; 1 Cor. 3:16-17."},{"id":"12A.19","text":"Seek good and not evil; hate evil, love good.","refs":[{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":7,"verses":"15-16"},{"book":"Amos","chapter":5,"verses":"14-15"}],"citation":"Isa. 7:15-16; Amos 5:14-15."}]}